[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2875331133","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103955#issuecomment-2875331133","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103955","id":2875331133,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rYhI9","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-13T07:17:59Z","updated_at":"2025-05-13T07:19:26Z","body":"Hi, thank you for the report!\n\nThis is an interesting failure mode. We do indeed have fallback logic, but we only check for the ability to connect. We also hard-crash on Wayland protocol errors (i.e. the compositor disconnecting us because we've been a bad client) and while that could be improved, what you're reporting is unrelated even to that.\n\nThe info you attached is really interesting but unfortunately the Godot part does not have debug symbols. Could you please [build Godot](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/contributing/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.html) with debug symbols and attach new stack traces?\n\nAlso, I think it might be very useful to also get a full verbose log, like this:\n```sh\nWAYLAND_DEBUG=1 insert_path_to_godot_here --verbose 2>&1 | tee godot.log\n```\n\nSince the Wayland backend is still experimental, we enable by default a lot of extra verbose print statements which will hopefully help track down where exactly the issue is happening.\n\nAll of this supposing it's not an environment issue, but we can't say that for sure. It might as well be related to screen scaling or something since it's a floating point exception.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2875331133/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3072062272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103955#issuecomment-3072062272","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103955","id":3072062272,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63G_NA","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"